  "duration_s": 675.376916,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国历史上被写进古诗里最多的名城是哪一座吗？上集，咱们聊了苏州、成都、武汉、岳阳、扬州这集，直接揭开谜底，看看前五名多到什么程度，尤其是排在榜首的那座城，不靠湖，不靠水，把一世的功名与跌宕全融进了两万多首诗的字里行间。这五座里除说不定就有您家那座，看看他排第几。看到这儿觉得有点意思的朋友，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，收藏起来，省得手一滑，咱们就错过了。第五名，洛阳十三个朝代在这定过都也叫神都写洛阳写洛城的诗，五千多首，唐朝有钱的人。五书的人都爱在洛阳置一处宅院，白居易晚年干脆搬了进去。在吕道坊买了房，挖池塘，种竹子，前后住了十七年，七十五岁走的葬在龙门山上，唐朝人写洛阳离不开花。刘禹锡写唯有牡丹真国色，花开时节动京城。牡丹一开，满城的人放下手里的活，出门看花李白春夜在洛阳听见谁家吹笛，也写了一句，何人不起故园情，一只笛子吹得满城人想家。到今天，洛阳每年四月还办牡丹，花卉，满城牡丹一起开。您想想那是什么场面？第四名，开封八朝古都北宋的时候叫东京，也叫汴京。据统计，写汴京繁华，想汴京救世的宋词有上万阙。这座城有多热闹？夜市开到三更才散，五更又开张，大相国寺，每个月开五回庙会卖什么的，都有人挤得迈不开步。宋其一句红杏枝头春意闹，硬把春天鞋炒了。可这份热闹没撑到头一一二七年，金兵打下汴京，皇帝被抓走，大家逃去南方再没回来。后来黄河几次绝口，把汴京埋进了地下。今天开封城底下摞着好几座古城，您去清明上河园，大相国寺走一圈，看到的是复原的热闹。宋朝人想回家的话一句一句还留在词里。第三名，南京，古时候叫金陵，六个朝代，在这建过都写金陵，写情怀写微巷的诗，九千多首。东晋的王道谢，安两大家族就住在威巷，当年是最有权势的人家。到了唐朝，刘禹锡，路过朱雀桥边长满野草，乌衣巷口斜照着夕阳。他写就时王谢堂前燕，飞入寻常百姓家，燕子还认得老地方，门里，已经换了人。杜牧把船停在秦淮河边，隔岸有人在唱后庭花。杜牧听着写下烟笼寒水月笼沙。今天您到夫子庙河边，灯笼一亮，有人吃小吃，有人听曲。王谢的大宅子早就落成了寻常日子，九千多首诗写尽的起起落落，给后世所有人换来了一份看透浮沉的清醒。第二名，杭州古时候叫钱塘，也叫临安，写杭州，写西湖写钱唐的诗。一万两千多首苏轼，任知州时修筑苏堤，写下欲把西湖比西子，淡妆浓抹总相宜说，不管晴天雨天这处水色，都美如绝代佳人，白居易也写下最爱湖东行不足。绿杨阴里白沙堤。两位顶尖文豪不仅用诗写他，更亲手挖泥筑堤，把整座西湖雕琢，成了中国山水的样板。您今天清晨走在苏堤之上，两岸柳丝拂面，烟波浩渺。哪怕是不懂事的人心神，也被洗的干干净净。一万两千多首诗密密麻麻，绣满了西湖的水面。天下文人把对人间圣境最极致的念想全砸在了这座湖山里。那第一名到底是谁？为什么写了一万两千首的杭州都只能排第二？先别急，我跟您说几句实在话，咱们这代人唐诗宋词谁嘴里都能念上几句，可光会背诗，您真觉得就算懂了老祖那点家底吗？诗是写在纸上的，城是立在地上的，这些城当年是怎么起来的？守过什么，丢过什么，诗里，一个字都不写。很多老朋友跟我聊过，年轻时候忙工作，顾家，没那个闲心。现在岁数到了，反倒越来越想把这块琢磨明白。平时跟老同学老战友出去走走，到了地方，大家扎堆拍个照，买点特产也就完了。您要是能站在城门楼，等底下念出一句诗，再顺手说一句，这城当年是干什么的，后来怎么败的？旁边的人自然高看您一眼。还有一件更要紧的，现在家里都有孙子孙女儿放假带孩子去古迹。孩子指着城门楼问一句，这地方以前是干嘛的？您要是当场翻手机查，那就露怯了。能给孩子的除了吃穿还有一样。他问什么？您答得上来。前阵子我翻到一套书叫中国历史名城中央民族大学出版社出的符号中国系列，他讲的是这些城的来路。这座城为什么建在这个位置，当过哪个朝代的都城，出过什么人，遭过什么难，后来又怎么留到了今天？说白了，咱们国家这些立了几千年的老城书里，一座一座单开一篇一座城的建制兴衰人物大意，几页纸就给您讲透了，配的彩色插图字也大，看着不累。我自己是常年搁在茶几上，闲了泡壶热茶翻两页带，孙子孙女出门前先翻一翻到了地方。您就是孩子眼里最懂行的那个跟老朋友聚会闲聊，天说出来的话也扎实，不是网上现抄的。喜欢文史，心里装着家国的朋友，真可以在家里备一套，我放在左下方商品里了，感兴趣的去瞅一眼，好说回正题，第一名西安，古称长安，为什么是他？杭州写了一万两千首，大家都以为他稳拿。第一，可大数据一统计长安二字，加上西京、曲江等称谓，在唐宋诗词里被写了整整两万多回，足足比第二名多出了将近一倍。唐朝的读书人头等大事就是考进长安，一辈子的指望都压在这儿。孟郊考了好几回，前头落过榜，四十六岁才中进士，高兴的写下春风得意马蹄疾，一日看尽长安花。骑着马一天就把满城的花看完了，可同一座城也能让人疼。安史之乱，杜甫被困在这儿，看见的是国破山河在，城春草木深，山河还在，城里只剩草木。一句话，把这座城的藤写透了，少年白居易带着文稿踏进城门，写下野火烧不尽春风吹又生，从此名扬天下。今天您去大雁塔，当年的新科进士就在塔下提名去曲江池遗址公园。当年的新科进士就在这儿摆宴。杭州比的是湖扬州，比的是河长安，比的是读书人，心里最大的那个念想。两万多首诗从这里喷涌而出，每一手里装的都是大唐文人，拿命去博的虔程。和天下十座城讲完了苏州在客船里敲响了千年晚钟。成都在草堂绿竹中安顿的诗圣残年。武汉在黄鹤楼前送进的天涯游子，岳阳在八百里洞庭边挺直了文人家国。扬州在大运河波光里，聚起了八千首风乐洛阳在龙门颐河畔，守着神都富贵。开封把汴京市井填成了上万。宋词南京在乌衣巷口看透了六朝沉浮。杭州用两道长堤把西湖装进了一万两千首绝唱，可只有长安把一个读书人一辈子的欢喜和眼泪全装在了里头。数字排的是诗，数出来的是人最多的那座城，不是最美的地方，是人心里最放不下的地方。读懂这些诗句，落地的古迹名城，您才算真正摸到了咱们华夏文脉的根。想顺着这条根往下读最才说的那本中国历史名城，左下方商品里就有爱看古城古迹的朋友别错过。最后问问您，这十座名城，您去过几座最想去的是哪一座？评论区告诉我，觉得这期让您长了见识，就转给身边跟您一样。爱看人文名城的人。想读懂更多古城古迹里的文脉故事，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 4830,
      "text": "您知道中国历史上被写进古诗里最多的名城是哪一座吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5190,
      "end_ms": 5690,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5690,
      "end_ms": 11110,
      "text": "咱们聊了苏州、成都、武汉、岳阳、扬州这集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00004",
      "start_ms": 11190,
      "end_ms": 12610,
      "text": "直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12870,
      "end_ms": 14930,
      "text": "看看前五名多到什么程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15470,
      "end_ms": 18290,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00007",
      "start_ms": 19010,
      "end_ms": 19790,
      "text": "不靠湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20230,
      "end_ms": 20930,
      "text": "不靠水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21490,
      "end_ms": 27870,
      "text": "把一世的功名与跌宕全融进了两万多首诗的字里行间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00010",
      "start_ms": 28510,
      "end_ms": 31660,
      "text": "这五座里除说不定就有您家那座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32020,
      "end_ms": 33040,
      "text": "看看他排第几。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33480,
      "end_ms": 35560,
      "text": "看到这儿觉得有点意思的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00013",
      "start_ms": 35880,
      "end_ms": 38020,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00014",
      "start_ms": 38199,
      "end_ms": 39020,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00015",
      "start_ms": 39280,
      "end_ms": 40220,
      "text": "省得手一滑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00016",
      "start_ms": 40320,
      "end_ms": 41300,
      "text": "咱们就错过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00017",
      "start_ms": 41580,
      "end_ms": 42320,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00018",
      "start_ms": 42640,
      "end_ms": 50400,
      "text": "洛阳十三个朝代在这定过都也叫神都写洛阳写洛城的诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00019",
      "start_ms": 50720,
      "end_ms": 51720,
      "text": "五千多首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00020",
      "start_ms": 52420,
      "end_ms": 53820,
      "text": "唐朝有钱的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00021",
      "start_ms": 54000,
      "end_ms": 57340,
      "text": "五书的人都爱在洛阳置一处宅院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00022",
      "start_ms": 57720,
      "end_ms": 59915,
      "text": "白居易晚年干脆搬了进去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60310,
      "end_ms": 61865,
      "text": "在吕道坊买了房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00024",
      "start_ms": 62330,
      "end_ms": 63090,
      "text": "挖池塘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00025",
      "start_ms": 63470,
      "end_ms": 64335,
      "text": "种竹子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00026",
      "start_ms": 64780,
      "end_ms": 66295,
      "text": "前后住了十七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00027",
      "start_ms": 66660,
      "end_ms": 69375,
      "text": "七十五岁走的葬在龙门山上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00028",
      "start_ms": 69840,
      "end_ms": 72975,
      "text": "唐朝人写洛阳离不开花。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00029",
      "start_ms": 73400,
      "end_ms": 76595,
      "text": "刘禹锡写唯有牡丹真国色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77050,
      "end_ms": 79315,
      "text": "花开时节动京城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00031",
      "start_ms": 80160,
      "end_ms": 80960,
      "text": "牡丹一开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00032",
      "start_ms": 81300,
      "end_ms": 83355,
      "text": "满城的人放下手里的活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00033",
      "start_ms": 83700,
      "end_ms": 88135,
      "text": "出门看花李白春夜在洛阳听见谁家吹笛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00034",
      "start_ms": 88530,
      "end_ms": 89535,
      "text": "也写了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00035",
      "start_ms": 89980,
      "end_ms": 91805,
      "text": "何人不起故园情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00036",
      "start_ms": 92380,
      "end_ms": 95315,
      "text": "一只笛子吹得满城人想家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00037",
      "start_ms": 95770,
      "end_ms": 96565,
      "text": "到今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00038",
      "start_ms": 96950,
      "end_ms": 99250,
      "text": "洛阳每年四月还办牡丹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00039",
      "start_ms": 99250,
      "end_ms": 99765,
      "text": "花卉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00040",
      "start_ms": 100250,
      "end_ms": 101775,
      "text": "满城牡丹一起开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00041",
      "start_ms": 102300,
      "end_ms": 103885,
      "text": "您想想那是什么场面？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00042",
      "start_ms": 104270,
      "end_ms": 105005,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00043",
      "start_ms": 105340,
      "end_ms": 110155,
      "text": "开封八朝古都北宋的时候叫东京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00044",
      "start_ms": 110660,
      "end_ms": 111845,
      "text": "也叫汴京。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00045",
      "start_ms": 112460,
      "end_ms": 113135,
      "text": "据统计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00046",
      "start_ms": 113560,
      "end_ms": 115125,
      "text": "写汴京繁华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00047",
      "start_ms": 115620,
      "end_ms": 119085,
      "text": "想汴京救世的宋词有上万阙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00048",
      "start_ms": 119760,
      "end_ms": 121405,
      "text": "这座城有多热闹？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00049",
      "start_ms": 121880,
      "end_ms": 123700,
      "text": "夜市开到三更才散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00050",
      "start_ms": 123900,
      "end_ms": 125235,
      "text": "五更又开张，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00051",
      "start_ms": 125640,
      "end_ms": 126440,
      "text": "大相国寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00052",
      "start_ms": 126500,
      "end_ms": 129100,
      "text": "每个月开五回庙会卖什么的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00053",
      "start_ms": 129100,
      "end_ms": 131435,
      "text": "都有人挤得迈不开步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00054",
      "start_ms": 131960,
      "end_ms": 134585,
      "text": "宋其一句红杏枝头春意闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00055",
      "start_ms": 134930,
      "end_ms": 136455,
      "text": "硬把春天鞋炒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00056",
      "start_ms": 136900,
      "end_ms": 140885,
      "text": "可这份热闹没撑到头一一二七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00057",
      "start_ms": 141340,
      "end_ms": 142925,
      "text": "金兵打下汴京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00058",
      "start_ms": 143350,
      "end_ms": 144375,
      "text": "皇帝被抓走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00059",
      "start_ms": 144680,
      "end_ms": 146935,
      "text": "大家逃去南方再没回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00060",
      "start_ms": 147340,
      "end_ms": 149125,
      "text": "后来黄河几次绝口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00061",
      "start_ms": 149620,
      "end_ms": 151405,
      "text": "把汴京埋进了地下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00062",
      "start_ms": 152020,
      "end_ms": 155510,
      "text": "今天开封城底下摞着好几座古城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00063",
      "start_ms": 155950,
      "end_ms": 157530,
      "text": "您去清明上河园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00064",
      "start_ms": 157730,
      "end_ms": 159275,
      "text": "大相国寺走一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00065",
      "start_ms": 159910,
      "end_ms": 162015,
      "text": "看到的是复原的热闹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00066",
      "start_ms": 162560,
      "end_ms": 167305,
      "text": "宋朝人想回家的话一句一句还留在词里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00067",
      "start_ms": 167710,
      "end_ms": 168410,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00068",
      "start_ms": 168690,
      "end_ms": 169415,
      "text": "南京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00069",
      "start_ms": 170180,
      "end_ms": 171305,
      "text": "古时候叫金陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00070",
      "start_ms": 171680,
      "end_ms": 172345,
      "text": "六个朝代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00071",
      "start_ms": 172590,
      "end_ms": 174830,
      "text": "在这建过都写金陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00072",
      "start_ms": 175110,
      "end_ms": 177465,
      "text": "写情怀写微巷的诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00073",
      "start_ms": 177830,
      "end_ms": 178775,
      "text": "九千多首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00074",
      "start_ms": 179180,
      "end_ms": 181000,
      "text": "东晋的王道谢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00075",
      "start_ms": 181060,
      "end_ms": 184045,
      "text": "安两大家族就住在威巷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00076",
      "start_ms": 184570,
      "end_ms": 186775,
      "text": "当年是最有权势的人家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00077",
      "start_ms": 187180,
      "end_ms": 188115,
      "text": "到了唐朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00078",
      "start_ms": 188620,
      "end_ms": 189200,
      "text": "刘禹锡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00079",
      "start_ms": 189200,
      "end_ms": 192515,
      "text": "路过朱雀桥边长满野草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00080",
      "start_ms": 192930,
      "end_ms": 195215,
      "text": "乌衣巷口斜照着夕阳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00081",
      "start_ms": 195590,
      "end_ms": 198935,
      "text": "他写就时王谢堂前燕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00082",
      "start_ms": 199440,
      "end_ms": 201625,
      "text": "飞入寻常百姓家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00083",
      "start_ms": 202230,
      "end_ms": 204145,
      "text": "燕子还认得老地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00084",
      "start_ms": 204570,
      "end_ms": 205070,
      "text": "门里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00085",
      "start_ms": 205270,
      "end_ms": 206265,
      "text": "已经换了人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00086",
      "start_ms": 206750,
      "end_ms": 209055,
      "text": "杜牧把船停在秦淮河边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00087",
      "start_ms": 209620,
      "end_ms": 211785,
      "text": "隔岸有人在唱后庭花。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00088",
      "start_ms": 212430,
      "end_ms": 216965,
      "text": "杜牧听着写下烟笼寒水月笼沙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00089",
      "start_ms": 217440,
      "end_ms": 219950,
      "text": "今天您到夫子庙河边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00090",
      "start_ms": 219990,
      "end_ms": 220835,
      "text": "灯笼一亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00091",
      "start_ms": 221200,
      "end_ms": 222300,
      "text": "有人吃小吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00092",
      "start_ms": 222700,
      "end_ms": 223935,
      "text": "有人听曲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00093",
      "start_ms": 224520,
      "end_ms": 228015,
      "text": "王谢的大宅子早就落成了寻常日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00094",
      "start_ms": 228450,
      "end_ms": 231445,
      "text": "九千多首诗写尽的起起落落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00095",
      "start_ms": 231840,
      "end_ms": 236345,
      "text": "给后世所有人换来了一份看透浮沉的清醒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00096",
      "start_ms": 236770,
      "end_ms": 237495,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00097",
      "start_ms": 237950,
      "end_ms": 240815,
      "text": "杭州古时候叫钱塘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00098",
      "start_ms": 241420,
      "end_ms": 242305,
      "text": "也叫临安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00099",
      "start_ms": 243050,
      "end_ms": 243985,
      "text": "写杭州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00100",
      "start_ms": 244690,
      "end_ms": 247535,
      "text": "写西湖写钱唐的诗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00101",
      "start_ms": 248360,
      "end_ms": 250500,
      "text": "一万两千多首苏轼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00102",
      "start_ms": 250500,
      "end_ms": 252625,
      "text": "任知州时修筑苏堤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00103",
      "start_ms": 252990,
      "end_ms": 255135,
      "text": "写下欲把西湖比西子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00104",
      "start_ms": 255530,
      "end_ms": 258170,
      "text": "淡妆浓抹总相宜说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00105",
      "start_ms": 258230,
      "end_ms": 260805,
      "text": "不管晴天雨天这处水色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00106",
      "start_ms": 261070,
      "end_ms": 262475,
      "text": "都美如绝代佳人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00107",
      "start_ms": 263040,
      "end_ms": 266145,
      "text": "白居易也写下最爱湖东行不足。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00108",
      "start_ms": 266730,
      "end_ms": 268535,
      "text": "绿杨阴里白沙堤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00109",
      "start_ms": 269030,
      "end_ms": 271630,
      "text": "两位顶尖文豪不仅用诗写他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00110",
      "start_ms": 271890,
      "end_ms": 274185,
      "text": "更亲手挖泥筑堤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00111",
      "start_ms": 274620,
      "end_ms": 276380,
      "text": "把整座西湖雕琢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00112",
      "start_ms": 276380,
      "end_ms": 278345,
      "text": "成了中国山水的样板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00113",
      "start_ms": 278760,
      "end_ms": 281445,
      "text": "您今天清晨走在苏堤之上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00114",
      "start_ms": 282070,
      "end_ms": 283535,
      "text": "两岸柳丝拂面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00115",
      "start_ms": 283840,
      "end_ms": 284925,
      "text": "烟波浩渺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00116",
      "start_ms": 285390,
      "end_ms": 288090,
      "text": "哪怕是不懂事的人心神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00117",
      "start_ms": 288150,
      "end_ms": 289825,
      "text": "也被洗的干干净净。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00118",
      "start_ms": 290280,
      "end_ms": 292600,
      "text": "一万两千多首诗密密麻麻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00119",
      "start_ms": 292620,
      "end_ms": 294315,
      "text": "绣满了西湖的水面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00120",
      "start_ms": 294770,
      "end_ms": 300890,
      "text": "天下文人把对人间圣境最极致的念想全砸在了这座湖山里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00121",
      "start_ms": 301170,
      "end_ms": 302730,
      "text": "那第一名到底是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00122",
      "start_ms": 303450,
      "end_ms": 307770,
      "text": "为什么写了一万两千首的杭州都只能排第二？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00123",
      "start_ms": 308150,
      "end_ms": 308850,
      "text": "先别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00124",
      "start_ms": 309150,
      "end_ms": 310809,
      "text": "我跟您说几句实在话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00125",
      "start_ms": 311250,
      "end_ms": 316450,
      "text": "咱们这代人唐诗宋词谁嘴里都能念上几句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00126",
      "start_ms": 316790,
      "end_ms": 318050,
      "text": "可光会背诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00127",
      "start_ms": 318430,
      "end_ms": 321530,
      "text": "您真觉得就算懂了老祖那点家底吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00128",
      "start_ms": 322210,
      "end_ms": 324135,
      "text": "诗是写在纸上的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00129",
      "start_ms": 324580,
      "end_ms": 326240,
      "text": "城是立在地上的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00130",
      "start_ms": 326640,
      "end_ms": 328680,
      "text": "这些城当年是怎么起来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00131",
      "start_ms": 329060,
      "end_ms": 330000,
      "text": "守过什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00132",
      "start_ms": 330200,
      "end_ms": 331080,
      "text": "丢过什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00133",
      "start_ms": 331420,
      "end_ms": 331840,
      "text": "诗里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00134",
      "start_ms": 331840,
      "end_ms": 332699,
      "text": "一个字都不写。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00135",
      "start_ms": 333060,
      "end_ms": 334560,
      "text": "很多老朋友跟我聊过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00136",
      "start_ms": 334920,
      "end_ms": 336400,
      "text": "年轻时候忙工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00137",
      "start_ms": 336720,
      "end_ms": 337180,
      "text": "顾家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00138",
      "start_ms": 337540,
      "end_ms": 338560,
      "text": "没那个闲心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00139",
      "start_ms": 339100,
      "end_ms": 340420,
      "text": "现在岁数到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00140",
      "start_ms": 340639,
      "end_ms": 343820,
      "text": "反倒越来越想把这块琢磨明白。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00141",
      "start_ms": 344160,
      "end_ms": 347180,
      "text": "平时跟老同学老战友出去走走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00142",
      "start_ms": 347560,
      "end_ms": 348380,
      "text": "到了地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00143",
      "start_ms": 348580,
      "end_ms": 349940,
      "text": "大家扎堆拍个照，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00144",
      "start_ms": 350240,
      "end_ms": 351960,
      "text": "买点特产也就完了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00145",
      "start_ms": 352360,
      "end_ms": 354380,
      "text": "您要是能站在城门楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00146",
      "start_ms": 354380,
      "end_ms": 356845,
      "text": "等底下念出一句诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00147",
      "start_ms": 357460,
      "end_ms": 359000,
      "text": "再顺手说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00148",
      "start_ms": 359060,
      "end_ms": 360995,
      "text": "这城当年是干什么的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00149",
      "start_ms": 361480,
      "end_ms": 362815,
      "text": "后来怎么败的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00150",
      "start_ms": 363250,
      "end_ms": 365695,
      "text": "旁边的人自然高看您一眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00151",
      "start_ms": 366140,
      "end_ms": 367545,
      "text": "还有一件更要紧的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00152",
      "start_ms": 368040,
      "end_ms": 372815,
      "text": "现在家里都有孙子孙女儿放假带孩子去古迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00153",
      "start_ms": 373330,
      "end_ms": 375245,
      "text": "孩子指着城门楼问一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00154",
      "start_ms": 375640,
      "end_ms": 377415,
      "text": "这地方以前是干嘛的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00155",
      "start_ms": 377950,
      "end_ms": 380125,
      "text": "您要是当场翻手机查，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00156",
      "start_ms": 380560,
      "end_ms": 381405,
      "text": "那就露怯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00157",
      "start_ms": 381810,
      "end_ms": 385795,
      "text": "能给孩子的除了吃穿还有一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00158",
      "start_ms": 386050,
      "end_ms": 386910,
      "text": "他问什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00159",
      "start_ms": 387130,
      "end_ms": 388215,
      "text": "您答得上来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00160",
      "start_ms": 388760,
      "end_ms": 397395,
      "text": "前阵子我翻到一套书叫中国历史名城中央民族大学出版社出的符号中国系列，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00161",
      "start_ms": 397840,
      "end_ms": 399775,
      "text": "他讲的是这些城的来路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00162",
      "start_ms": 400470,
      "end_ms": 402575,
      "text": "这座城为什么建在这个位置，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00163",
      "start_ms": 403320,
      "end_ms": 405285,
      "text": "当过哪个朝代的都城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00164",
      "start_ms": 406080,
      "end_ms": 407165,
      "text": "出过什么人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00165",
      "start_ms": 407510,
      "end_ms": 408515,
      "text": "遭过什么难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00166",
      "start_ms": 409090,
      "end_ms": 411325,
      "text": "后来又怎么留到了今天？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00167",
      "start_ms": 411740,
      "end_ms": 412415,
      "text": "说白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00168",
      "start_ms": 412750,
      "end_ms": 416920,
      "text": "咱们国家这些立了几千年的老城书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00169",
      "start_ms": 416920,
      "end_ms": 423885,
      "text": "一座一座单开一篇一座城的建制兴衰人物大意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00170",
      "start_ms": 424290,
      "end_ms": 426245,
      "text": "几页纸就给您讲透了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00171",
      "start_ms": 426770,
      "end_ms": 429145,
      "text": "配的彩色插图字也大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00172",
      "start_ms": 429600,
      "end_ms": 430265,
      "text": "看着不累。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00173",
      "start_ms": 431000,
      "end_ms": 433500,
      "text": "我自己是常年搁在茶几上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00174",
      "start_ms": 433960,
      "end_ms": 437090,
      "text": "闲了泡壶热茶翻两页带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00175",
      "start_ms": 437090,
      "end_ms": 441015,
      "text": "孙子孙女出门前先翻一翻到了地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00176",
      "start_ms": 441400,
      "end_ms": 446610,
      "text": "您就是孩子眼里最懂行的那个跟老朋友聚会闲聊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00177",
      "start_ms": 446610,
      "end_ms": 449535,
      "text": "天说出来的话也扎实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00178",
      "start_ms": 450150,
      "end_ms": 451925,
      "text": "不是网上现抄的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00179",
      "start_ms": 452390,
      "end_ms": 453395,
      "text": "喜欢文史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00180",
      "start_ms": 453850,
      "end_ms": 455485,
      "text": "心里装着家国的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00181",
      "start_ms": 455830,
      "end_ms": 457335,
      "text": "真可以在家里备一套，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00182",
      "start_ms": 458110,
      "end_ms": 460385,
      "text": "我放在左下方商品里了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00183",
      "start_ms": 460940,
      "end_ms": 462855,
      "text": "感兴趣的去瞅一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00184",
      "start_ms": 463320,
      "end_ms": 464855,
      "text": "好说回正题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00185",
      "start_ms": 465250,
      "end_ms": 467000,
      "text": "第一名西安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00186",
      "start_ms": 467500,
      "end_ms": 468435,
      "text": "古称长安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00187",
      "start_ms": 469230,
      "end_ms": 470435,
      "text": "为什么是他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00188",
      "start_ms": 470880,
      "end_ms": 473015,
      "text": "杭州写了一万两千首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00189",
      "start_ms": 473500,
      "end_ms": 475060,
      "text": "大家都以为他稳拿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00190",
      "start_ms": 475060,
      "end_ms": 475515,
      "text": "第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00191",
      "start_ms": 476040,
      "end_ms": 479025,
      "text": "可大数据一统计长安二字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00192",
      "start_ms": 479410,
      "end_ms": 482155,
      "text": "加上西京、曲江等称谓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00193",
      "start_ms": 482540,
      "end_ms": 486575,
      "text": "在唐宋诗词里被写了整整两万多回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00194",
      "start_ms": 487120,
      "end_ms": 489745,
      "text": "足足比第二名多出了将近一倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00195",
      "start_ms": 490430,
      "end_ms": 494975,
      "text": "唐朝的读书人头等大事就是考进长安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00196",
      "start_ms": 495470,
      "end_ms": 497995,
      "text": "一辈子的指望都压在这儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00197",
      "start_ms": 498350,
      "end_ms": 499835,
      "text": "孟郊考了好几回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00198",
      "start_ms": 500270,
      "end_ms": 501350,
      "text": "前头落过榜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00199",
      "start_ms": 501870,
      "end_ms": 503885,
      "text": "四十六岁才中进士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00200",
      "start_ms": 504460,
      "end_ms": 507215,
      "text": "高兴的写下春风得意马蹄疾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00201",
      "start_ms": 507570,
      "end_ms": 509225,
      "text": "一日看尽长安花。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00202",
      "start_ms": 509700,
      "end_ms": 512545,
      "text": "骑着马一天就把满城的花看完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00203",
      "start_ms": 512960,
      "end_ms": 516005,
      "text": "可同一座城也能让人疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00204",
      "start_ms": 516410,
      "end_ms": 517305,
      "text": "安史之乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00205",
      "start_ms": 517730,
      "end_ms": 519035,
      "text": "杜甫被困在这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00206",
      "start_ms": 519310,
      "end_ms": 521705,
      "text": "看见的是国破山河在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00207",
      "start_ms": 522040,
      "end_ms": 523465,
      "text": "城春草木深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00208",
      "start_ms": 524200,
      "end_ms": 525360,
      "text": "山河还在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00209",
      "start_ms": 525600,
      "end_ms": 527385,
      "text": "城里只剩草木。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00210",
      "start_ms": 527790,
      "end_ms": 528405,
      "text": "一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00211",
      "start_ms": 528750,
      "end_ms": 530825,
      "text": "把这座城的藤写透了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00212",
      "start_ms": 531250,
      "end_ms": 534515,
      "text": "少年白居易带着文稿踏进城门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00213",
      "start_ms": 535240,
      "end_ms": 539215,
      "text": "写下野火烧不尽春风吹又生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00214",
      "start_ms": 539860,
      "end_ms": 541705,
      "text": "从此名扬天下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00215",
      "start_ms": 542180,
      "end_ms": 543755,
      "text": "今天您去大雁塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00216",
      "start_ms": 544180,
      "end_ms": 550020,
      "text": "当年的新科进士就在塔下提名去曲江池遗址公园。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00217",
      "start_ms": 550340,
      "end_ms": 553155,
      "text": "当年的新科进士就在这儿摆宴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00218",
      "start_ms": 553570,
      "end_ms": 556250,
      "text": "杭州比的是湖扬州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00219",
      "start_ms": 556330,
      "end_ms": 558090,
      "text": "比的是河长安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00220",
      "start_ms": 558130,
      "end_ms": 559390,
      "text": "比的是读书人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00221",
      "start_ms": 559690,
      "end_ms": 562065,
      "text": "心里最大的那个念想。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00222",
      "start_ms": 562890,
      "end_ms": 566165,
      "text": "两万多首诗从这里喷涌而出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00223",
      "start_ms": 566980,
      "end_ms": 569805,
      "text": "每一手里装的都是大唐文人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00224",
      "start_ms": 570110,
      "end_ms": 572090,
      "text": "拿命去博的虔程。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00225",
      "start_ms": 572090,
      "end_ms": 578845,
      "text": "和天下十座城讲完了苏州在客船里敲响了千年晚钟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00226",
      "start_ms": 579500,
      "end_ms": 582875,
      "text": "成都在草堂绿竹中安顿的诗圣残年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00227",
      "start_ms": 583560,
      "end_ms": 586575,
      "text": "武汉在黄鹤楼前送进的天涯游子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00228",
      "start_ms": 587300,
      "end_ms": 590765,
      "text": "岳阳在八百里洞庭边挺直了文人家国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00229",
      "start_ms": 591240,
      "end_ms": 593240,
      "text": "扬州在大运河波光里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00230",
      "start_ms": 593380,
      "end_ms": 597940,
      "text": "聚起了八千首风乐洛阳在龙门颐河畔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00231",
      "start_ms": 598140,
      "end_ms": 599595,
      "text": "守着神都富贵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00232",
      "start_ms": 600140,
      "end_ms": 603140,
      "text": "开封把汴京市井填成了上万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00233",
      "start_ms": 603140,
      "end_ms": 607540,
      "text": "宋词南京在乌衣巷口看透了六朝沉浮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00234",
      "start_ms": 608020,
      "end_ms": 613540,
      "text": "杭州用两道长堤把西湖装进了一万两千首绝唱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00235",
      "start_ms": 614200,
      "end_ms": 621020,
      "text": "可只有长安把一个读书人一辈子的欢喜和眼泪全装在了里头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00236",
      "start_ms": 621720,
      "end_ms": 623340,
      "text": "数字排的是诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00237",
      "start_ms": 624000,
      "end_ms": 627240,
      "text": "数出来的是人最多的那座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00238",
      "start_ms": 627740,
      "end_ms": 629425,
      "text": "不是最美的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00239",
      "start_ms": 629970,
      "end_ms": 632590,
      "text": "是人心里最放不下的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00240",
      "start_ms": 632990,
      "end_ms": 634390,
      "text": "读懂这些诗句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00241",
      "start_ms": 634530,
      "end_ms": 636130,
      "text": "落地的古迹名城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00242",
      "start_ms": 636990,
      "end_ms": 640670,
      "text": "您才算真正摸到了咱们华夏文脉的根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00243",
      "start_ms": 641490,
      "end_ms": 646950,
      "text": "想顺着这条根往下读最才说的那本中国历史名城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00244",
      "start_ms": 647590,
      "end_ms": 652810,
      "text": "左下方商品里就有爱看古城古迹的朋友别错过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00245",
      "start_ms": 653250,
      "end_ms": 654310,
      "text": "最后问问您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00246",
      "start_ms": 654730,
      "end_ms": 656170,
      "text": "这十座名城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00247",
      "start_ms": 656550,
      "end_ms": 660365,
      "text": "您去过几座最想去的是哪一座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00248",
      "start_ms": 660750,
      "end_ms": 661825,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00249",
      "start_ms": 662250,
      "end_ms": 664325,
      "text": "觉得这期让您长了见识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00250",
      "start_ms": 664810,
      "end_ms": 667210,
      "text": "就转给身边跟您一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_694c5c6c2ec99ce8_s00251",
      "start_ms": 667250,
      "end_ms": 668815,
      "text": "爱看人文名城的人。"
    },
    {
